1	/**
2	 * PostgresStore — the cloud persistence adapter.
3	 *
4	 * Implements the same Store contract as SqliteStore over `pg`, so flipping
5	 * DEPLOY_MODE to cloud is a wiring change, not a code change (ISC-58). It runs
6	 * the same portable DDL from schema.ts and the same `ON CONFLICT` upserts; only
7	 * the placeholder dialect differs ($1..$n here vs ? in SQLite). Every tenant
8	 * query is scoped by user_id (ISC-49).
9	 *
10	 * This adapter must COMPILE and pass the shared store suite; it is not the local
11	 * runtime default.
12	 */
