7	 * the template (ISC-72), and the budget history that records every template
8	 * change and every auto-roll with before/after (ISC-77).
9	 *
10	 * Allocations are materialised one row per (envelope, period). The template is
11	 * the standing plan; an ongoing change edits the template and the current
12	 * period, a this-month change edits only the current period (ISC-68).
13	 */
14	
