5	 * (ISC-57). Every other module depends on the Store interface. Every method
6	 * that touches tenant data is scoped by userId in the WHERE clause (ISC-49).
7	 *
8	 * Upserts use `INSERT ... ON CONFLICT (...) DO UPDATE`, which both bun:sqlite
9	 * and Postgres understand, so the business-visible SQL stays portable (ISC-59).
